  78 +                                                                                                                               
  79 +Empirical analysis of the MAXIMUM = 1000 run (248,502 pairs; 30,884 sole                                                       
  80 +parity-tail wins). Write N = m+n, q = floor(N/m) (parity tail's stride), and                                                   
  81 +r = N mod m, so N = qm + r.                                                                                                    
